Language Feature
    Reference
        - Numbered Column
            syntax: @2
            reach: tables only
        - Named Column
            syntax: @price
            reach: tables and line values
        - Cross Cell
            syntax: @price@Alpha
            note: either order works, @price@Alpha or @Alpha@price
        - Cross Table
            syntax: @Sales Ledger@total@Alpha
            note: name the other table first, the Concept, Example or Attribute it sits under; it may live in any file in the repo
    Type Constraint
        - Date Type
            keyword: date
            example: 1815-12-10
        - Number Type
            keyword: number
            example: 42
        - Text Type
            keyword: text
            example: hello
    String Function
        - upper
            turns: widget into WIDGET
        - lower
            turns: WIDGET into widget
        - trim
            turns: padded text into a tight one

Working Demonstration
    Sales Ledger
        |name |price        |qty >=1|total          |
        |-----+-------------+-------+---------------|
        |Alpha|10           |2      |20 =@price*@qty|
        |Beta |2 =@Alpha@qty|4      |5              |
        |Total|             |       |25 =sum(@4)    |
    Ledger Check
        |name       |from the ledger              |
        |-----------+-----------------------------|
        |alpha total|20 =@Sales Ledger@total@Alpha|
        |price sum  |12 =sum(@Sales Ledger@price) |
    Person Record
        birth date is date
        age is number >=0
        - Ada Lovelace
            birth date: 1815-12-10
            age: 36
        - Alan Turing
            birth date: 1912-06-23
            age: 41
    Label Builder
        - Widget Label
            base: widget
            code: WIDGET =upper(@base)
        - Gadget Label
            base: gadget
            code: GADGET =upper(@base)
    Documentation
        repository page: https://github.com/Jakus23/alphabet-of-thought
        readme file: README.md
        change log entry: 1.3.0
